{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Waddington-OT 使用跨时间进程采集的 scRNA-seq 表达谱来推断概率分布随时间的演化。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "It uses scRNA-seq data collected across a time-course to infer how these probability distributions evolve over time, by using the mathematical approach of Optimal Transport (OT)."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "该方法旨在刻画每个细胞在基因表达空间中的可能来源与可能命运分布。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "each cell has a distribution of both probable origins and probable fates"
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的条件包含每个时间点的单细胞表达谱和四个有序时间点，这与该方法所需的时间进程表达快照在形式上一致。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:expression_profiles",
        "user:sampling"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "该方法要求表达谱带有采样时间元数据，用于区分不同时间点。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "It uses scRNA-seq data collected across a time-course to infer how these probability distributions evolve over time"
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：该方法通过最优传输计算相邻时间点之间的耦合，并隐含假设细胞命运只取决于当前位置而与历史无关，即马尔可夫假设；这属于模型假设，不代表已证实你的数据满足该假设。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 4,
          "quote": "The optimal-transport calculation (i) implicitly assumes that a cell’s fate depends on its current position but not on its previous history (i.e., the stochastic process is Markov)"
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：不同时间点独立采样会丢失时间点之间的联合分布，因此该方法推断的是概率性时间耦合，而不是对同一批细胞的直接物理谱系追踪。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 5,
          "quote": "because different cells are sampled independently at different time points, we lose the joint distribution of expression between pairs of time points, called temporal coupling"
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "现有证据只说明该方法支持基于时间进程表达快照推断可能来源与命运，但未提供针对四个时间点这一具体采样设计的适用性结论。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": null
}
